<title>USA: Noble Drilling to redeem preferred stock.</title>
<headline>Noble Drilling to redeem preferred stock.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noble Drilling Corp said Thursday it redeeming its $1.50 convertible preferred stock, par value $1.00 per share.</p>
<p>The redemption price is $26.05 a share plus accrued dividends from Oct 1 through redemption date.</p>
<p>Dividends from Oct 1 will be paid to holders of record Dec 20.</p>
<p>Each preferred share is convertible into 2.4446 shares of the company's common stock until such conversion right expires at 1800 EST Dec 31.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
